  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2018 - 2020 programme funds will conduct trachoma mapping to understand its prevalence; implement Surgery, Antibiotics, Facial cleanliness, and Environmental improvements, and prepare and submit elimination validation dossiers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity  2018 - 2020 programme funds will conduct trachoma mapping to understand its prevalence; implement Surgery, Antibiotics, Facial cleanliness, and Environmental improvements, and prepare and submit elimination validation dossiers   is a component of Contributing Towards Eliminating Blinding Trachoma in the Commonwealth reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;6,658,753. It works in the following sector(s): Health policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
